    "tree_id": "5d289f191d400e5114182f4fb125ab12d7dea2e1",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:629] build(delivery): request private IPA 629 again (MeloNX Core 628 and RPCS3 Core 627) on the recorded 626\n\nAttempt 1 (run 41618683768) failed at the RPCS3 Core install check: the fixed marker list asked for the canary file\nof Cores 587-624, which Core 627 renames to rewindbox-mvk-async-627.txt on purpose. The recipe fix (the commit before)\naccepts the canary named after its Core. Refrozen on 79d866ef: same effective digest 140e5707, 6897 product files,\nreplayed from the delivered 626 effective tree b8403d43; legal check passed; no conflict, no unclassified commit.\n- MeloNX Core 628 (run 41614833262, source 1ce1cd14, packaged fingerprint dfd9061e) replaces the Core 626 (18fbb04c).\n- RPCS3 Core 627 (run 41610162888, source 6891f9a0, payload eccf8535) replaces the Core 624 (e906fbd5).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JA5QgKeoGVH5oVjNyhcj3D",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-03T10:46:54Z",
